# Implementation Plan - Phase 7: Course Management System

This plan details the design and implementation of the Course Management System, fulfilling all requirements for Phase 7 on both the backend API server and the admin panel frontend.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **SQLite SQLite-net Core Reference:** To parse the SQLite database packages uploaded inside the ZIP files on the backend server, we will introduce the `Microsoft.Data.Sqlite` dependency to the `LeitnerPlatform.API` project. This library is lightweight and does not require system-level installations, making it fully cross-platform.
> **Static Directory Mapping:** The uploaded ZIP course packages will be stored locally in `wwwroot/courses/` on the API server. We will enable `app.UseStaticFiles()` in ASP.NET Core so that clients can securely download packages over standard HTTPS.

## Open Questions

- *None at this time. The requirements are clear, and the design aligns directly with the previously defined specs and patterns.*

